{"seq":2,"slug":"type-checking","title":"类型检查","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-rules-judgments","title":"类型规则与判断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/type-rules-judgments","wordCount":1596,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"type-inference","title":"类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/type-inference","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"subtyping-coercion","title":"子类型与隐式转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/subtyping-coercion","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"类型检查\">类型检查</h1><p>当名字都已绑定、符号表已就绪，编译器终于可以问出那个核心问题：这个程序的类型对吗？本章把类型检查从一门「直觉手艺」提升为一套可以形式化、可以证明、可以机械执行的理论，是整个 hub 在技术深度上的脊梁。</p>\n<p>第一篇是类型规则与判断。它引入贯穿类型理论的记号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma \\vdash e : \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>——在上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 之下表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 具有类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>——并用一组推理规则精确刻画哪些程序是良类型的。这套规则不仅是检查算法的蓝图，也是讨论类型安全（soundness）的语言。后两篇都建立在这套记号之上。</p>\n<p>第二篇讲类型推断：当程序员懒得写类型注解时，编译器如何自己把类型算出来。这一篇是 Hindley-Milner 类型系统与 Algorithm W 的主场，讲清类型变量、约束收集、合一（unification）与泛化（generalization）如何协作，让 ML、Haskell、乃至 Rust 与 TypeScript 的局部推断成为可能。</p>\n<p>第三篇讲子类型与隐式转换，处理真实语言无法回避的灵活性：一个 <code>Cat</code> 能不能当 <code>Animal</code> 用？一个 <code>int</code> 要不要自动变成 <code>double</code>？这里会讲清协变与逆变、结构子类型与名义子类型的分野，以及隐式转换在带来便利的同时埋下的陷阱。从「规则」到「推断」再到「关系」，本章构成了类型检查的完整三联画，也为第三章把表达力推向极限铺好了路。</p>\n"}